N5008 [temp.deduct.type]/9, Example 4: S<int, const int &, const int &>
matches `S<T1, const Z &...>' with Z = {int, int}.  The front end selects
the primary template; with one element the specializations are matched and
ordered correctly (cpp11_partial_specialization_pack_expansion_less_
specialized).  Not yet diagnosed.  Pre-existing (bin53).  g++ 13 and clang++
18 accept this program, and it fails only its WRONG assertion.
